  "body": "Sections like [§4.8.4.3.10](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#parsing-a-srcset-attribute) and [§4.8.4.3.11](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#parsing-a-sizes-attribute) (and probably other sections) lack markup for attributes. See e.g. prose like “Parsing a srcset attribute” (instead of “Parsing a `srcset` attribute”) and “When asked to parse a sizes attribute” (instead of “When asked to parse a `sizes` attribute”).\r\n\r\nThis lack of markup and formatting makes the spec less readable and understandable.\r\n\r\n(I’m open to prepare a PR for this, but would prefer to briefly coordinate on this off-thread with someone who would also review the PRs. I’ll be happy to explain this preference in private.)",
